gr=dict(t='Grammar – Subject–Verb Agreement', p=[
 'The verb must agree with its subject in number and person.',
 'Two subjects joined by “and” → plural verb: Amma and Appa are fast asleep.',
 'Words between subject and verb do not change it: The information on travel expenses is useful.',
 '“There is/are”: the subject comes after the verb – There are so many hills here.',
 'each, either, every, neither, much → singular verb: Each of the children was given a gift.',
 'Nouns ending in -s but meaning one thing → singular: Mathematics is interesting. The news makes…',
 '“A pair of …” → singular: This pair of scissors is sharp.',
 'Subjects joined by or / nor → verb agrees with the nearer subject: Neither the students nor the teacher wants… / Either the manager or the employees are…']),
